## Nette (`nette/schema`, `nette/utils`) — transitive via League CommonMark

Pulled transitively through `league/commonmark` → `league/config`. Upstream
packages are dual-licensed (BSD-3-Clause **or** GPL). ARK consumes them as
unmodified Composer dependencies through League’s stack; retain upstream
license texts from `vendor/` when redistributing a built tree.

